WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.201
The big T. rex stomped.

2
00:00:09.202 --> 00:00:15.058
He roared.

3
00:00:15.059 --> 00:00:18.476
"Ha-ha!" the T. rex said.

4
00:00:18.477 --> 00:00:23.337
"I'm big and scary!"

5
00:00:23.338 --> 00:00:26.099
Small animals ran.

6
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.415
The buddies watched them.

7
00:00:29.416 --> 00:00:34.578
"Roar!" The T. rex chased lizards.

8
00:00:34.579 --> 00:00:37.513
One lizard was green.

9
00:00:37.514 --> 00:00:45.053
It was near a green bush.

10
00:00:45.054 --> 00:00:50.373
The T. rex didn't see the lizard.

11
00:00:50.374 --> 00:00:53.880
"That's a clever lizard," Sara said.

12
00:00:53.881 --> 00:00:57.611
"Yeah!" Rex said.

13
00:00:57.612 --> 00:01:07.711
A squirrel had babies.

14
00:01:07.712 --> 00:01:12.801
She hid them.

15
00:01:12.802 --> 00:01:18.177
Then the squirrel led the T. rex away.

16
00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:23.651
"That's a brave squirrel," Tor said.

17
00:01:23.652 --> 00:01:27.623
"Hey, T. rex!" another squirrel yelled.

18
00:01:27.624 --> 00:01:30.428
"Get out of here!"

19
00:01:30.429 --> 00:01:35.198
The buddies looked over.

20
00:01:35.199 --> 00:01:38.848
Three squirrels threw pebbles.

21
00:01:38.849 --> 00:01:42.860
The pebbles hit the T. rex's foot.

22
00:01:42.861 --> 00:01:46.473
"Roar!"

23
00:01:46.474 --> 00:01:50.171
The squirrels ran and hid.

24
00:01:50.172 --> 00:01:54.197
The T. rex turned around.

25
00:01:54.198 --> 00:02:02.749
The squirrels threw more pebbles.

26
00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:07.959
"Good for them," Sara said.

27
00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:12.570
Sid nodded. "They're small but brave!"

28
00:02:12.571 --> 00:02:16.155
Suddenly Sara had an idea.

